Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is JoJo's Bizarre Adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.34,0:00:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In the 19th century, as the United States\Nof America explored its vast continent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest conquest was\Nthat of the western frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It beckoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and a desire called\NAmerica sped across the map
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,claiming native lands as its own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.82,0:01:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,till it reached the wide Pacific
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.99,0:01:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastard's got it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.50,0:01:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He had white men's books\Nhidden in his tent!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell is he so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.54,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's running the\Nsame way the white men do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.61,0:01:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,he ran it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was there, in the west,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,where the Santa Ana headwinds\Nblow in from Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that people gathered\Nin the summer of 1890,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,every one of them, in search of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, which one of you left all\Nthat mess in the shitter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my tech, you love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.96,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Center trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I was here first!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the first ever Steel Ball Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This epic trek, which will commence here\Nin San Diego and end in New York City,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,will be the first ever\Nto have its participants
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,cross North America while on horseback!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,4,000 mind-boggling miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.76,0:02:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At the end of the race's nine stages,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,our victor will receive a\Npeerless prize of $50 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Many racers will vie for these riches,\Nbut only one will walk away the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A question, Mr. Steele.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Baron Rucatugo from Germany says he\Nintends to compete from atop an automobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And with my blessing. For what is\NAmerica if not a land of progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wants to trust a machine, then\Nthat is a good baron's prerogative.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The $150 entry fee has been called\Na money-making scheme by some.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You wound me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We are covering the medical\Nexpenses of any racer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,who meets with misfortune\Nduring the endeavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,However, each racer is\Nresponsible for their own safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We acknowledge their right to bear arms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,enshrined as it is within the Second\NAmendment of the Constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.26,0:03:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The race will go down as a failure if\Nno one makes it to the finish line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If that should occur, what do you\Nthink your investors will have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably just kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.14,0:03:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:04:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You speak to me of failure,\Nthen I will speak in turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no failure\Nworse than turning your
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,back on adventure to\Nperish in bed untested,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.84,0:04:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,having never faced the\Nimpossible, and carried the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come what may, this race\Nis a triumph of the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our racers don't know\Nthe meaning of failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how the days ahead may unfold,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,the steel ball run will\Nbe a race the likes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,of which the world has\Nnever laid eyes upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do, Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the whole thing falls apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.14,0:04:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Steven, you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you've been a promoter\Nfor 40 years, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it'll all work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm guessing you're here to\Nsign up for the race, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.38,0:05:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna need your John Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take your fingerprints and\Nhorse's nose prints on the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just know you can't swap out the\Njockey or the horse down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Taddlecloth and your entry certificate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyrocephaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are some unusual\Nbaubles you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.06,0:05:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They do something or\Nare they just for show?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.82,0:05:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.28,0:06:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just curious about\Nthose balls or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean no harm.\NThat right, hey, clerk, how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,much of my entry fee is\Non the counter huh if the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.08,0:06:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,money's all there why\Nthen I guess I've got no
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,quarrel with you oh you came
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,up short $20 but I did pay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.94,0:06:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the full amount didn't\NI still hadn't given you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,your receipt nothing's\Nofficial till I do I wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,where that cash might have\Nrun off to you're going
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To give back what you\Npilfered. Because if you don't,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,they won't let me compete in the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And that would mean I don't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's a thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Security, come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me my damn receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Caught him thieving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.16,0:06:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Valkyrie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.60,0:06:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to find a tent and make\Nmyself at home for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.88,0:07:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't done with you yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, no how!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever shit you pulled in there,\NI'd like to see you try that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your wriggling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.10,0:07:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, fool's got a hold of my gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Food for thought, Goldteeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wanted you dead, you'd\Nbe warm food right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you act all high and mighty, but\Nyou never saw me grabbing those coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.72,0:07:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the law sicked on me\Nfor nothing more than a guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.88,0:07:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And that I cannot abide!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm joining the race!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That way you'll never see me coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Only thing you're joining is a\Nchain gang. Enough. Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.02,0:07:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not pressing charges.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lock him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And give him a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.84,0:08:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick it up, take it, take it,\Nand see what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,we're out of our league\Nhere where's the sheriff
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're about to see some bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss about? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.80,0:08:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.42,0:08:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't think I\Nmeant all that, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was kidding! No harm done!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, I don't much like the\Nway you're looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.78,0:08:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.69,0:08:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't gonna hurt you none honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:09:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, best of luck in the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.88,0:09:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one of you boys up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I didn't do worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I would find a doctor for\Nthat arm if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And drop the gun while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody could get hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.40,0:09:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheriff, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.48,0:09:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another duel nothing\Nto lose sleep over a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.26,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,duel both men agreed to so it goes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Duel my ass
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not even sure what happened
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That ball he threw It was spinning fast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast that it dug right into his\Narm And even that didn't slow it down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.82,0:10:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up. What's\Nthat steel ball about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see it again Hand it over\NNo, don't It's still spinning, damn it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just then I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.72,0:10:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.36,0:10:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, you old bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know what that was just now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.16,0:10:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna tell me everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.84,0:10:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Top cause of death. Wanna take a guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosquito-borne diseases\Nare killer number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting kicked by a horse\Nis definitely the runner-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to get him to switch\Nplaces on the podium or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.58,0:11:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get your hopes up. I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.46,0:11:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You standing up from that chair\Nwas nothing more than coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.12,0:11:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A muscle spasm, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.24,0:11:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A spasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the steel ball. I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me touch it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.66,0:11:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can pay you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.66,0:11:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with this little conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you mouthy brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I was\Ngoing to let that slide?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't hand over the ball\Nto me, I'll take it by force now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:12:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess there's no harm in\Ngiving you a bit of credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sporting some pretty\Nwell-conditioned muscles up above.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,quite a feat considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The spin of the steel balls won't\Nmagically let you walk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't just give you your legs back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to believe that\Nafter what I've seen them do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes, I'm going to\Nfigure out the mystery of the spin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When you can't even ride a horse,\NI'll be gone in two days' time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a cross-country\Nrace that needs winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on! Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.92,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's in the way now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll watch your mouth\Nnext time, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.94,0:12:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Scram already. Roll on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why I came to\Nthis beach in San Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.30,0:13:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it just to witness the\Nstart of the steel ball run?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Or was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Johnny Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My father was a rancher and\Na well-known horse trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So all of my life, horses\Nhave been by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching their muscles\Nwork from atop the saddle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.22,0:13:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,hearing their hooves strike\Nthe ground, it was beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever they ran, it felt like I could\Nunderstand their thoughts and emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Like we shared a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful things demand our attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's something dynamic and alive,\Ntoo, there's nothing more captivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Young master Johnny has talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So said the old stable\Nhand, and I believed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But my father remained aloof.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For my older brother Nicholas\Nwas already a rising star.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Until an accident\Nclaimed his life one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.06,0:14:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and everything changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.82,0:14:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,After his death, I began racing horses\Nin earnest and won time and time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They started calling me a prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With each new victory, more\Npeople would gravitate to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.14,0:14:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,paying homage with their flattery,\Ntheir gifts, their money.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,To win a race on horseback was a triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mastering oneself and the beast\Nbelow, it felt like manifest destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But destiny had something\Nelse in mind. Just you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,wait once you see how\Ndazzling she is you won't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,make fun of me anymore\Nis dorothy parker that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,great i'm telling you\Njohnny the day will come
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.94,0:14:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,when the world treats\Nactresses like works of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.36,0:14:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,art i guess that would\Nexplain the crowd i've been
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:15:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,waiting in line you know\Nyeah so i've been in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.22,0:15:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,line since yesterday oh\Nyeah and look what it got
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.98,0:15:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the line is back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.82,0:15:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here all night!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just cut in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to shut up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No one gives a shit that\Nyou pulled an all-nighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone had better\Ntell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.62,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was standing in line fair and square when\Nthis guy walked up and tried to cut in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, this is Johnny Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.10,0:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were the coolest, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, is this\Nthing worth the trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole life changed yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.72,0:16:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nurse!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you, stupid? Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shitting myself over here,\Nand there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up and clean\Nthis shit off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.28,0:16:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your goddamn job, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this\Ntube going into my leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you dumb son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet, or I'll give you\Nsomething you can yell about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you care if I tap\Nyou for a couple of pints?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like you can feel your legs anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't it crazy that you've never\Nhad one visitor the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.16,0:16:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even your own? Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.84,0:16:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes people sick to look\Nat you, did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot Shit Jockey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're covered in hot shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.82,0:17:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what, I will learn the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he's keeping and i will ride a horse again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.84,0:17:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so what do you think valkyrie\Nseen any horses we should
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.40,0:17:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,be worried about me i don't\Nthink we'll have any trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.50,0:17:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's still trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.38,0:17:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Been at it since last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard he's gonna compete in the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know the guy used\Nto be a famous jockey and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.96,0:17:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but I feel so bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Him being the horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.24,0:17:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hit like that had to hurt for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.30,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He trying to regain his\Nformer glory or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Good way to get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'd be screaming if that were me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They say he got injured bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and he can't feel pain down\Nthere that horse He bought isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,helping things any it's old\Nhot-blooded and got a hell of a temper
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotta stop this. You\Nagree with me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Only saw what happened to him right\Nnow, but in my professional opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.70,0:18:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he's riding that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not down a working pair of legs
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,let me put it this way if you can ride\Nthat horse then he's stubborn as all hell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.14,0:18:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,i want to enter the\Nrace is that right gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,pay the entry fee with\Nlegal american tender
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,so can you pay or can't you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,huh this is a a giant emerald
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Certificate in Saddlecloth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take your horse's nose\Nprint right before the start, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.10,0:18:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:19:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will cross the continent and win\Nusing only the legs I was born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To get that prize money, I'll\Nbeat them at their own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow is the big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.80,0:19:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.64,0:19:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.30,0:19:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we're minutes away from the start of the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.98,0:19:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,first ever race across\Nthe length of America,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.64,0:19:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the Steel Ball Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere down here at the beach\Nis a heady blend of anticipation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,ambition, and horse poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.06,0:20:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, here come the jockey's\Nmost favored to win the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.32,0:20:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The cowboy hailing from Wyoming,\NMountain Tim Atop his trusty steed,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow Rider
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.76,0:20:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mongolian master of\Nhorsemanship himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.16,0:20:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dot Han. His horse's name is Number\NOne. The nomad from the Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.70,0:20:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Urm Davdal He intends to race on a\Ncamel, if you can believe that And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.06,0:20:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,appearing atop the tried and true silver\Nbullet Proudly bearing Saddle Cross 001,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the heir apparent of British horse racing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.42,0:20:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Diego Brando!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The first stage of the race\Nis a simple 10-mile circuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.12,0:20:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ending in the shadow of an old church.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of today's leg will\Nreceive a one-hour time bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as a $10,000 prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.82,0:20:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, I welcome you to the first\Never opening day of the Steel Ball Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take note, my lucky observers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall move once the race is underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the special locomotives, we\Nshall follow the race in the lap of luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.18,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, the idiot from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's pat as a hair. Or dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to learn the secret of\Nthose steel balls, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.00,0:21:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose the right horse\Nfor the race, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.40,0:21:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,An old horse knows what it's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't rush to the head of the pack\Nand sprain a leg from all the excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're interesting, so here's a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You already know the\Nanswer to this question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.40,0:22:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have enough will to ride a horse,\Nthen why don't you put it into action?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.52,0:22:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Two minutes until the starting gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.04,0:22:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Ella.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lick me one more time. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.44,0:22:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the Steel Ball Run to begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.08,0:22:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,10 AM, September 25th, 1890,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.96,0:22:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,on the first transcontinental\Nrace across North America,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.36,0:23:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the Steel Ball Run is finally underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.14,0:23:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.12,0:23:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How's he controlling the horse\Nif he can't even use his legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm with you, I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.28,0:23:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll uncover it in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dying trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Saddle clock, 6-3-6, faster and faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.12,0:23:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running like the wind down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.36,0:23:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.42,0:24:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,6-3-6 is Gyro Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.96,0:24:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who runs their horse that hard\Nright off the starting line?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.42,0:24:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No way is he going to make it\Nto New York riding like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.20,0:24:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But he said he was going to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.98,0:24:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Said that's what he came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.78,0:24:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're swerving No good I can't afford\Nto get tangled up between these two
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Two riders are down This may be the\Nend of their steel ball run, folks
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules of the race do allow\Nfor ramming one's opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.02,0:24:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.93,0:24:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Another jucky is broken away from\Nthe pack. It's Diego Brando the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.24,0:24:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,heir apparent of the British horse\Nracing world is closing in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Weights, and he's not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Another racer is searching ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.70,0:24:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell for leather.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.46,0:24:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Irm Dabdall and his colossus of a camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.58,0:25:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My steed weighs 50 % more than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.32,0:25:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a horse alive\Nthat can withstand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.32,0:25:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A close shave for Jiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.38,0:25:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Diego Brando presses the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.18,0:25:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,60 minutes of bonus time and\N$10,000 will belong to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.36,0:25:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,En-Dabdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.14,0:25:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.98,0:25:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,En-Dabdol is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.28,0:25:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he miss that cactus\Npatch? It's plain as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.30,0:25:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's getting up, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.20,0:25:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Irm Davdal, a favor to win, is unexpectedly\Nknocked out in the first stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.00,0:26:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Gyro's steel ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.86,0:26:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how it works,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.74,0:26:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but he used one of his steel\Nballs to locate a bunch of cacti
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.86,0:26:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And then he lured the camel\Nrider right into it. Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,not only the balls but\Ntheir wielder too i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,take what i can get in\Nlife so long as it's
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.84,0:26:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,not contagious and that\Ngoes double for extra time
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.82,0:26:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.34,0:26:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell hey
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.56,0:26:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,uh it isn't tin yet right
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.32,0:26:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.02,0:26:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I overslept!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.14,0:26:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't refund your entry fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.34,0:26:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta be in the race to\Nwin that 50 million, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.48,0:26:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.84,0:26:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win the whole ball of quacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.92,0:26:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.86,0:26:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm captain of my own destiny\Nand a smooth jelly ahead, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.88,0:27:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, some weirdo just started the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.70,0:27:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we should mark it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.58,0:27:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Saddle clock 777.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.64,0:27:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Name's Poco Loco. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.80,0:27:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it my birthday or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.32,0:27:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this ground is super smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.06,0:27:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The other horse has\Nalready pounded it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure wouldn't feel this even if we\Nstarted racing when we should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Uncle is on fire today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.30,0:27:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.12,0:27:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I think it's through,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.88,0:27:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,at 400 yards per liter of fuel,\Nwe're not going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.90,0:27:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.26,0:27:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we return to our\Nhomeland, my dear Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cairo Zeppeli still holds\Nthe lead with Diego Brando,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.00,0:27:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,also known as Dio, not far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That jockey, his movements\Nhave been odd for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.08,0:27:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Chasing to the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.72,0:27:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,closing in to the left, slowly\Nshrinking the gap between him and Jairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.14,0:28:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And again. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.12,0:28:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Dio have discovered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.32,0:28:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.84,0:28:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To hell with your tricks, Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.62,0:28:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.26,0:28:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He caught up the gyro in no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What devilry is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.68,0:28:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't look like his horse sped up any.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.20,0:28:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a bit surprised by\Nyour trick with the camel,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I deem you no\Nmore than a rank amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see how this will unfold.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.48,0:28:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro's horse has a tell,\Nand Dio, he figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so easy to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.48,0:28:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has their tells,\Nand horses are no exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.18,0:28:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe one switches its\Ntail about before charging,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,or runs wide when it feels cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.52,0:28:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The shake of a head, the angle of a back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.28,0:28:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Races are won and lost on\Nthe secrets those can betray.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.88,0:28:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This horse's habit is specific indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:29:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Five, six, seven, and here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.28,0:29:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it sways slightly to the left\Nevery eight breaths like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.52,0:29:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That lateral motion\Nresults in a loss of speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.44,0:29:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If I increase my speed\Nat that precise moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.34,0:29:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can erase his lead without tiring out\Nmy horse and then claim it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.46,0:29:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio's in front by half a length!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Dare to explain how you pulled that off?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.24,0:29:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called technique, you troglodyte.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.70,0:29:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back there and\Nlearn from your betters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.52,0:29:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.66,0:29:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insinuating my horse has a tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.30,0:29:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it even matter if I told\Nyou habits are carved in stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.44,0:29:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Indelible like fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.72,0:29:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dio is pulling ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look as though he's speeding\Nup, but he's definitely in front now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.92,0:29:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Genius at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.46,0:29:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you're observing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.42,0:29:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro won't be able to pass him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The gap's just going\Nto get wider and wider.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight miles to go in this leg of the race\Nas the pack clears a dried-up riverbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.80,0:30:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea\Nof having a tell, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.08,0:30:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's news to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of strong horses\Nand riders out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.16,0:30:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The same for the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.38,0:30:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't need to\Nchange what you're about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.20,0:30:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I say you double down on it instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.18,0:30:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're\Nswerving a bit down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.56,0:30:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, hope that's not a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.38,0:30:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.80,0:30:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.00,0:30:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep swerving and see where it gets you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Brick, whose planks are giving way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.28,0:30:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyrocephaly leaps, ice water in his veins!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.92,0:30:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Geo hesitates!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.98,0:30:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.89,0:31:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The other riders are\Ndiverting across the riverbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.88,0:31:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but Geo is stuffed in his tracks!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.32,0:31:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like before, with my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.06,0:31:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The mysterious steel balls spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It amplified the horse's habit\Nwith the burst of power! Yo, whoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.90,0:31:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We got up to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.88,0:31:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the pack right\Nnow, but not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.84,0:31:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.10,0:31:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That cliff's looking pretty steep!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.14,0:31:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't part of the god darn route.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.28,0:31:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all, we're here because of him!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.72,0:31:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was charging ahead like a house\Nof fire and we got caught up in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.92,0:31:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but take a look at the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can get across here,\Nit's a hell of a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.46,0:31:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't risking a good horse on that jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.14,0:31:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going that-a-way. Screw this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.88,0:31:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.22,0:32:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, you up too sprawled out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.74,0:32:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just counting the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.56,0:32:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.47,0:32:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What I meant to say was,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.52,0:32:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,why the hell are you flopped on the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of helping me\Ndo an honest day's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.52,0:32:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days ago now, this old\Nfortune-teller lady read my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.87,0:32:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,she told me that the absolute\Nworst time in a person's life
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.68,0:32:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,is called the void of heaven\Nand earth But check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine is the exact opposite right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.62,0:32:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the best luck
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.50,0:32:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a doubt the next two months\Nwill be the most fortunate period of
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.62,0:32:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,your entire life Only one in five\Nbillion people have this kind of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.32,0:32:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So put it to good use kid
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.54,0:32:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got nothing to fear.\NThe world's your oyster. Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let me tell you about\Nyour first lucky break, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The owner of this field hired us to\Nget it ready for planting season.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.64,0:32:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna live the easy life from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.06,0:32:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Folks like us don't got\Nthe luxury of living easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.98,0:33:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I just forgot what\Nnumber of clout I was up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.76,0:33:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss would've paid you\N150 thanks to me putting
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.66,0:33:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,in a good word and here\Nyou are acting a damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.51,0:33:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're Gramps, that field\Nwork you were going on about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.14,0:33:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How much did you say it pays?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.30,0:33:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.54,0:33:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm galloping out of\NSan Diego with my faithful
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Steve and my one in five\Nbillion lucky streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.28,0:33:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.90,0:33:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, I'm\Ngrabbing that prize money!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.02,0:33:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going straight home and\Ndoing a whole lot of nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.24,0:33:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Throw a lasso if you have a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.26,0:33:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'll get lucky with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.48,0:34:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of legs\Ndoes that guy have on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.58,0:34:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not like he just saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.12,0:34:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back on solid ground thanks\Nto my top-shelf good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.08,0:34:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.98,0:34:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Yeah! Voodoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Only four miles to go in\Nthis first stage of the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.24,0:34:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro Zeppeli remains in the lead, but\Nwill it be true with the finish line?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Gyro's veering way\Noff course toward the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.58,0:34:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What manner of foley is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.02,0:34:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.80,0:34:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If he charges through the woods, he could\Ngain at least 800 yards on the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.10,0:34:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But sir, won't the trees\Npose a hazard to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.58,0:34:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.49,0:34:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gambling with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.28,0:34:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How will the pack respond to this move?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.04,0:34:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If he gets away from me now,\NI'll never catch up to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.36,0:35:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a taker!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.48,0:35:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, two, three, six,\Nbreaking for the trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.82,0:35:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.82,0:35:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.34,0:35:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the leader of the pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.02,0:35:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of got a late start.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.44,0:35:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.38,0:35:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're about to follow\Nhim straight into the tree line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.98,0:35:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty daunting, but good to kind\Nof look out back in these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.00,0:35:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Any shortcut is a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.91,0:35:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.74,0:35:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's writing with his eyes closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.88,0:35:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.86,0:35:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An old Poco Loco.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.90,0:35:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Portis' favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.98,0:35:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Missing every branch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No sight, no fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.62,0:35:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Horses dodge trees on their own,\Nbut that jockey isn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.00,0:35:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing has touched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.80,0:35:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The odds of that are a million to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.64,0:35:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that guy come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.38,0:35:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are his eyes closed?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's fishy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.66,0:36:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I should take him off the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.16,0:36:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Two minutes since they went in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.24,0:36:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They should appear any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.82,0:36:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The first one out of the woods is Gyro.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.56,0:36:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro Zeppeli is still in\Nthe lead with no comers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.12,0:36:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, a second horse dragging\Nits rider by the stirrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.92,0:36:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Saddleclaw 777, register\Nto Poco Loco. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.30,0:36:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,From the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.46,0:36:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco was able to dodge the trees and\Nallow his mouth to take the quickest path.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.40,0:36:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I fell off, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.38,0:36:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.12,0:36:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.03,0:36:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This look of mine is taking\Nme all the way! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.46,0:36:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.68,0:37:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco emerges in second place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.06,0:37:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the pack rounds the band\Non the official room are behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.54,0:37:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This position isn't terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.52,0:37:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The shortcut was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.24,0:37:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.15,0:37:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This race is always bang right\Nfrom the top just you wait the most
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,treacherous part of the route is\Nyet to come a Downhill stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.94,0:37:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,2,000 yards long with steep\N30-degree slopes and dizzying
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.92,0:37:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,hundred-foot drops How steep it's\Nnot terrain fit for a locomotive,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.66,0:37:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so we'll take a slight detour accordingly
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.14,0:37:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And now they face the\Ntreacherous downhill stretch if
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.70,0:37:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,our jockeys go too fast here\Nthe mounts can lose their
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.34,0:37:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Footing like that. Luckily,\Nthey're all holding steady, keeping
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.66,0:37:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,this pace is a true testament\Nto a writer's skill nice
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.94,0:37:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and slow we gotta take it\Neasy on this part nice and
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.96,0:37:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,slow don't tell me you're\Nchickening out now mr lucky huh
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.30,0:38:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,who's there i ain't chickening\Nout of nothing put it to
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.72,0:38:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,good use kid you got nothing to\Nfear the world's your Oyster!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.64,0:38:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.76,0:38:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The old woman said I had nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.12,0:38:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If the world's my oyster,\Nthen I better get cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.60,0:38:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a nap, old timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.98,0:38:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco's breaking away!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.68,0:38:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all caught up and then some!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.28,0:38:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Choc-a-fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.42,0:38:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.28,0:38:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky and an idiot. Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.70,0:38:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.88,0:38:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get riled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're searching ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.74,0:38:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The horses saw the leader pick up\Nspeed and can't help themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.96,0:38:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A co-level is fresh on\Nthe downsole, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The devil is taking his\Ndue today. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.02,0:38:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.16,0:38:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can snap us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.14,0:38:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.88,0:38:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro takes the lead.\NHey, kid. Much obliged.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.40,0:39:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco tempted fate and paid the piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.00,0:39:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.91,0:39:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the blue hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.68,0:39:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.66,0:39:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco and his horse are going\Nstrong and none the worse for wear!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost looks as though\Nthey were to top something!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.56,0:39:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dead cow! He's cooking!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.18,0:39:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.09,0:39:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer my steak with a little more meat\Non the bone, but I ain't complaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.54,0:39:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He takes the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.36,0:39:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This race is getting more\Nbizarre by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.20,0:39:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have some kind\Nof ability? No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.98,0:39:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,give a damn what kind\Nof moves he's packing
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.80,0:39:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,last night checked this\Nis a horse race you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.14,0:39:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,switch to a skeleton and\NI've got a bone to pick
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.84,0:39:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,one rock slide coming right up he hits any\Nof those and his cows out to pasture Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.78,0:39:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did he come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.88,0:39:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all. It didn't hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.96,0:40:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.18,0:40:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Saddlecloth 990 Sandman comes out of\Nnowhere to claim the lead on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're approaching the end of the slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.66,0:40:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.48,0:40:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We are 17 action-correct\Nminutes into this race.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.08,0:40:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.88,0:40:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The final turn is in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.72,0:40:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they pass these rocks, it's\Na straight shot to the finish!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.84,0:40:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman takes a shortcut right through!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.08,0:40:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him go, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.74,0:40:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.72,0:40:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's more than human.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.26,0:40:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The power of the native people runs deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.10,0:40:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In this race across the continents,\Nit will serve him in good stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.70,0:40:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The other racers have made their descent\Nand are headed for the final turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.10,0:40:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,3,800 racers, and Poco\NLoco is in the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.48,0:40:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gary, we're never gonna win if\Nwe keep staring at their asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.02,0:40:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time we got this show on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.44,0:41:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave him in the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gyro's making his move!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.12,0:41:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is taking the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.54,0:41:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But how's he going to keep it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.50,0:41:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a final 2,000-yard\Nstraightaway after this bend!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.66,0:41:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,there's so many people i have no idea\Namazing look at this sea of places
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.52,0:41:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,here in an old church on the edge of the\Nwilderness profited by the center and
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.02,0:41:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the headwinds tens of thousands of fans\Nwait to see who wins this first leg
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.98,0:41:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of the race, whoever does win this\Nrace will be a hero to the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You've run so well today and you've\Nbeen wise to save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.84,0:41:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But now we're at the finish, so let loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.80,0:42:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What, I can't believe it,\Nhe's back in the running!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.98,0:42:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.30,0:42:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the broken bridge stopped him in his\Ntracks and now he's leading the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hitting less wind resistance\Nin the other racers' wakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he caught up from so far back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.68,0:42:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner gets 50 million, but I don't\Ngive a damn about the prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.24,0:42:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to prove myself to that man,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.38,0:42:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to prove I'm worthy of knowing\Nthe secret of the Steel Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.84,0:42:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who will beat Gyro\NZeppeli in his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.56,0:42:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.47,0:42:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Johnny, don't start!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.10,0:42:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,From here until the finish,\Ntechnique isn't worth a dab.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.54,0:42:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Victory hinges on a single truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.70,0:42:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest legs prevail!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.82,0:42:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You got up easy before\Nthanks to that dead cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So I hope you're ready to go for broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.48,0:42:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Poco Loco Challenge is\Ninside of the finish line!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.76,0:42:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.86,0:43:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandman leaps into the final break!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.18,0:43:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that guy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.76,0:43:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 500 yards to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chasers know it's now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.38,0:43:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dio and 7 o'clock,\N9-3-9, Johnny Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.22,0:43:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They're closing in fast on Gyro,\Nwho's closing in fast on Sandman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.92,0:43:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's running to beat the man\Nwith Paul and Hunt Pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.02,0:43:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chasers are closing in on Gyro.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.00,0:43:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Three legs, two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.40,0:43:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, neck and neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.14,0:43:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got four horses neck and\Nneck as they fight for the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.56,0:43:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Johnny Joestar, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.14,0:43:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Catching up to me is no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.10,0:43:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.58,0:43:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been on a sailboat?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.08,0:43:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out the more headwind\Na sailboat catches,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.12,0:43:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the faster it cuts through the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.08,0:43:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel the Santa Ana up from Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.24,0:43:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps our horses do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.04,0:43:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.94,0:43:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Space Fiber in a bare-knuckle\Nbrawl for the lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,100 yards to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.32,0:43:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will persevere?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.12,0:43:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tyro Zeppelin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.84,0:44:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tyro's in the lead and what a sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.96,0:44:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ease out in front and pulling ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.08,0:44:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the steel balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.72,0:44:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He used the spin of the\Nsteel balls to spread his
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.28,0:44:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,cloak and gain lift through\NBernoulli's principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.26,0:44:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the sails of a ship filled\Nwith that headwind from Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.16,0:44:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dero's in the lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.32,0:44:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's untouchable.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.72,0:44:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,50 yards to the goal. Now 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.02,0:44:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not enough track to catch him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.04,0:44:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One last punch on Dero and...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.58,0:44:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.48,0:44:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Devo simply takes the crown
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.92,0:44:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,For the First Nation of Dazzling Victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.96,0:44:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,we have our first race\Nleader of the Steel Moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.40,0:44:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the summer of 1890, and I\Nwas drawn to the shores of the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.08,0:44:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Drawn by something beautiful,\Nglinting amid the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.90,0:44:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could call\Nit the light of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.78,0:45:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the story of how I began to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.54,0:45:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not literally, but in the sense\Nof walking the path to manhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It all began when I, Johnny Joestar,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.88,0:45:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,first met a mysterious\Nstranger named Gyro Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.86,0:46:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.62,0:46:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ladies and gentlemen, we just\Nsaw Jojo. People left, you right,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.62,0:46:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We never spot this place.\NYou can make no way,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.26,0:46:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must give it my one, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.92,0:47:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.92,0:47:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.46,0:48:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
